mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Alphabet第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，Google Cloud运营利润率升至35.6%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">黑森林实验室发布FLUX3多模态模型，支持20秒音视频生成与机器人行为预测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbf511116b0653d1158ca75dacce62e6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Black Forest Labs正式推出FLUX3多模态基础模型，该模型采用统一架构联合学习图像、视频和音频，并基于Self-Flow自监督流匹配框架扩展。FLUX3支持单次生成最长20秒的视频及原生音频，具备文生视频、图生视频、视频续写及多镜头串联等多种创作模式。在人工评测中，FLUX3在10秒720p视频生成任务中表现优异，对比Grok Imagine Video胜率达69%，对比Seedance 2.0和Gemini Omni Flash胜率均为52%。除内容创作外，FLUX3还具备图像生成与编辑能力。目前，Black Forest Labs正与Mimic Robotics合作，将FLUX3应用于机器人行为预测，旨在将多模态AI能力从数字内容生成延伸至实体机器人领域，打造连接数字与物理世界的通用多模态引</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源0.8B参数文档解析模型OvisOCR2，登顶OmniDocBench基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cb30ff938973a12cf696bd77d1ded8b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源0.8B参数规模的文档解析模型OvisOCR2，该模型在OmniDocBench v1.6基准测试中以96.58分登顶，成为首个超越传统流水线方法的端到端文档解析模型。OvisOCR2基于Qwen3.5-0.8B后训练，通过单模型一次生成即可输出包含文本、公式、表格及视觉区域的Markdown格式，解决了传统“版面分析+内容识别”流水线模式中误差累积与部署复杂的问题。技术上，该模型结合真实与合成数据，采用SFT、RL、OPD及模型融合等手段优化性能。目前，OvisOCR2已基于Apache 2.0协议在Hugging Face与魔搭社区开源，兼容vLLM推理框架。其小参数、高精度的特性大幅降低了RAG检索与企业知识库构建的算力门槛，推动文档智能技术向高效模型驱动范式转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年国际数学家大会揭晓菲尔兹奖，新科得主雅各布·齐默尔曼在赛后宣布将转向AI安全领域，并正式加入OpenAI。齐默尔曼凭借将o-极小性理论重塑为算术几何与复代数几何工具，成功证明格里菲斯周期图像代数性猜想及安德烈-奥尔特猜想，展现了顶尖数学天赋。OpenAI首席研究官马克·陈及研究员布贝克均公开确认并欢迎其加入，高度评价其在AI安全议题上的严谨态度与深刻思考。齐默尔曼出生于1988年，曾两度获得IMO金牌，师从数论名家彼得·萨纳克，此前任教于多伦多大学数学系。此次跨界不仅是个人职业选择，也反映出AI安全治理领域正吸引顶尖学术人才，其深厚的数论与算术几何背景将为OpenAI的AI安全研究提供底层数学支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f427fa5c2d92a15cc77ab1b6b6a1c035.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于7月23日正式宣布组织架构调整，将原混元多模态模型部门与大语言模型部门合并，新设基础模型部，并由腾讯首席AI科学家姚顺雨统一管理。此次重组旨在打破多模态与语言模型间的研发壁垒，提升模型研发协同效率，全力冲击全模态模型的智能上限。此前，姚顺雨已于去年12月兼任大语言模型部负责人，此次调整将“能看图”与“能对话”的技术路线收归同一指挥中枢，标志着腾讯混元在全模态模型研发上进入深度整合阶段。通过统一管理架构，腾讯意在加速混元模型在多模态融合领域的技术迭代，以应对行业对全模态大模型日益增长的性能需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Alphabet第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，Google Cloud运营利润率升至35.6%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet发布2026年第二季度财报，资本支出同比暴涨100%至创纪录的449.2亿美元，主要投向AI基础设施建设。核心业务Google Cloud表现强劲，营收同比增长82%达248亿美元，运营利润率从此前水平大幅提升至35.6%，积压订单规模达5140亿美元。在AI模型进展方面，Gemini月活用户已达9.5亿，其模型API每分钟处理的token量高达220亿。谷歌通过云业务的高增长与利润率扩张，支撑起大规模的资本开支投入。行业分析指出，超大规模云服务商的资本支出正处于高速增长周期，预计到2027年全球相关支出将突破万亿美元大关，AI基础设施建设正成为科技巨头重塑竞争格局的核心战略。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
